{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>All that he has, in the house and in the field.</b> In the house in the days of winter, and in the field in the days of summer. And so it says in Seder Olam that Joseph was a slave in his master's house only one year, [working in] house and field. And twelve years he was in the prison house."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 39, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:06:42.071743508Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}